<metadata><name>Day 65 (stop 1 of 2) - Curly Harnden, Bruce Caves Access Trail</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.776754" lon="-81.039717"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Gleason Lake Rd where the Curly Harnden Side Trail meets the Len…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.778131" lon="-81.063676"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.772282" lon="-81.073502"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Bruce Caves Access Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.772317" lon="-81.075221"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: End of the Bruce Caves Access Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
